<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 6.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 6.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set the</p>
<p>following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev for</p>
<p>Tuesday, May 6:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,496.20 (1,495.90)	CHF  1,017.00 (1,017.80)</p>
<p>    DEM    865.76 (865.68)	  GBP  2,424.10 (2,427.10)</p>
<p>    ATS    123.02 (123.01)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Monday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $26.28 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$21.53 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $47.81 million ($24.04 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
